 1472836, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scvkg4.jpg"}, {"id": 1472835, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scvkg3.jpg"}, {"id": 1472837, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scvkg5.jpg"}, {"id": 1472838, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scvkg6.jpg"}], "slug": "the-last-caretaker", "storyline": "You are the Last Caretaker, a lone machine reawakened after centuries of silence. The Earth is flooded, its towering megastructures rusting under an endless sky. The Seed Vaults remain, containing the last human seeds\u2014waiting to be born. Your mission is clear: recover the seeds, reactivate the Lazarus Complex, and launch the last of humanity to the stars.\n\nBut the world is not as empty as it seems. Machines still whisper old protocols, relics of the past still move with purpose, and your every step brings you closer to uncovering the meaning of your existence.", "summary": "The Last Caretaker is a thoughtful take on the survival-crafting genre, where every decision you make and every action has a consequence. Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted world where the fate of humanity rests in your hands. Your mission is clear: recover human seeds, reactivate the Lazarus Complex, and launch the last of humanity to the stars.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-last-caretaker", "videos": [{"id": 141826, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "0P0twgxYCLI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0P0twgxYCLI", "title": "The Last Caretaker - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0P0twgxYCLI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 153429, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "AS5s11VHfoQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AS5s11VHfoQ", "title": "The Last Caretaker Steam wishlist trailer - PC Gaming Show 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A